# drain-em-all-form.trk -- one row per bar (112). '>' ramps per bar; patch slews with func.
# Form: POWER ON 1-16, QUEUE 17-32, DISPATCH 33-48, FULL 49-64, MAINT 65-72,
# PEAK 73-88, DRAIN 89-104, DRAINED 105-112.

